<title>UK: Vtech lifts profits in year.</title>
<headline>Vtech lifts profits in year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			(million US$ unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (cents)		21.5		   vs 17.3</p>
<p> Dividend (cents)	 10.5		   vs 8.7</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 17.7		   vs 12.6</p>
<p> Pretax		     50.6		   vs 35.7</p>
<p> Turnover		   731.0		  vs 688.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Hong Kong-based VTech Holdings Ltd is a consumer electronics manufacturer.</p>
